  "title": "\"Rocks\"",
  "country": "US",
  "released": "1976-05-03",
  "notes": "This original release of \"Rocks\" comes with a textured cover on both the front & back, the title \"Rocks\" is shown in quotes, it contains a printed inner sleeve, and it lacks the \"All Rights Reserved...\" text on the back cover near the bottom.\n\nLater pressings feature: A) Plain smooth cover, B) The title Rocks is shown without quotes. C) The text \"All Rights Reserved...\" is printed on the back cover near the bottom.\n\nDedicated to the memories of Anthony D. Perry and Herb Spar.\n\nSTERLING & P are stamped in runouts \nThe stamped P denotes a [l447694] pressing.\nVariant 6 side A has no STERLING stamp",
  "released_formatted": "03 May 1976",
